PE 908: Clock Sequence II / 钟摆序列（二）

Clock sequences with period ≤ N where n-th segment sums to n.

=== Example sequence (period 6) ===
Sequence: 1 2 3 4 3 2
Segments:
  segment  1: 1 = 1 ✓
  segment  2: 2 = 2 ✓
  segment  3: 3 = 3 ✓
  segment  4: 4 = 4 ✓
  segment  5: 3 2 = 5 ✓
  segment  6: 1 2 3 = 6 ✓
  segment  7: 4 3 = 7 ✓
  segment  8: 2 1 2 3 = 8 ✓
  segment  9: 4 3 2 = 9 ✓
  segment 10: 1 2 3 4 = 10 ✓
  segment 11: 3 2 1 2 3 = 11 ✓
  segment 12: 4 3 2 1 2 = 12 ✓

=== Small C(N) values ===
=== PE 908: Clock Sequence Small Analysis ===

C(1) = 1
C(2) = 2
C(3) = 3
C(4) = 5
C(5) = 5
C(6) = 5

=== PE Answer ===
